          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Simulating the integral computational scale of biological human brains (~10¹⁵ synaptic calculations per second) systematically parsing, evaluating, and settling complex regulatory entropy into verifiable compliance assurance.
          </p>

          <!-- Live Particle / Waveform Canvas -->
          <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1.5">
              <span>Risk Settlement Harmonic Wave</span>
              <span id="settle-rate-percent" class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Entropy Quenched: 99.98%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-16 rounded-lg bg-[#060e1a] border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden relative">
              <canvas id="vectron-wave-canvas" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Fragments of Meaningful GRC & Cybersecurity Metrics -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
          
          <!-- Fragment 1: ISO 42001 & AI Act -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0b172a] border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors">
            <div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              [ISO 42001 / EU AI ACT]
            </div>
