            QUADRILLION OPS MATRIX
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-slate-400">Risk Settle:</span>
          <strong id="dock-settle-readout" class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">100.0% Verified</strong>
          <span class="hidden md:inline text-slate-500">•</span>
